  npcName: Shaman 2
  requestType: 0
  foodRequestLines:
  - "The spirits whisper of their hunger\uFFFD\uFFFD grant me a spoonful."
  medicineRequestLines: []
  foodAcceptLines:
  - Even the spirits rejoice at your choice.
  medicineAcceptLines: []
  foodRejectLines:
  - "A refusal echoes sharply\uFFFD\uFFFD the spirits grow restless."
  medicineRejectLines: []
  specialLines:
  - "when do you believe your spirit is at its weakest? / For me, it is when I behold
    something beautiful. / In a place thick with shadow such as this, a pale light
    is almost impossible to resist. / All the while never realizing\uFFFD\uFFFD that
    such light is often the darkest of all."
